<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Meitei: Roman Script 1st Translation</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Ephesus</para>
  <para style="toc1">EPHESUS-GI Misingda I-ba Paul-gi Chithi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephesus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eph</para>
  <para style="mt1">EPHESUS-GI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Misingda I-ba Paul-gi Chithi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Wahoudok</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulna Ephesus-ki misingda i-ba chithi asi chaorakna AD 61 aduwaida, Pual na Rome-gi keisumsangda leiringeida ikhibani. Chitthi asida ihan hanbada, swarga amasung malemda leiriba Tengban Mapugi khutsem pumnamakpu Christtana makok oiraga amata oina punsinba adu puraknaba Tengban Mapugi thourang adugi maramda i (1:10). Jisu Christtada amata oibagi mapanna mioiba phurup pumnamakna amata oina punsinbinabagidamak toubiba thourang asigi wahanthok aduda Tengban Mapugi misingna hingnanaba masida mahakna hairi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chithi asigi ahanba sarukta Paul-na, Ipa Ibungo Tengban Mapuna mahakki misingbu khandokpibagi lambi, Machanupa Jisu Christtagi mapanna karamna makhoibu pap kokpiba amadi makhoigi paptagi ning tamhanbiba, aduga Tengban Mapugi chaoraba wasak adubu Thawai Asengbagi mapanna soidre haibagi shakhi piba, hairibasing asi haiduna apunbagi hiram adu sagatli. Aduga anisuba sarukta apabasingda, makhoina Christtada amata oiminnaba adu makhoigi punsidasu asengba oibaga loinana hingminanaba kanna hairi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Christtada punsinjaduna Tengban Mapugi misingna amata oiba adu utnanaba tongan tongba wahei wata kaya sijinnei: Madudi, singlup haibasi Christtana makok oiba hakchang amagumbani, aduga Christtana chithekki nung oiba yum amagumbani, aduga Christtana mapuroiba oiba keinya amani haibasini. Christtada leiba Tengban Mapugi thoujal adugi wakhalna ayiba asibu chingbiduna chithi asibu phongdokpagi awangba thak adu youna kahalli. Pot pumnamak Christtagi nungsiba, katthokpa, ngakpiba, amadi thoujalgi asengba mangalda uba phang-i.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaopham Takpa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Wahoudok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Christta amasung singlup <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3–3:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Christtada anouba punsi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1–6:20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Waroisin <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Pakhon 18:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19:1</ref></char>
    </note>Tengban Mapuna ningbibagi mapanna Jisu Christtagi pakhonchatpa ama oiriba Paul eihakna,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Christta Jisuda thajaba yaba oiriba Ephesus-ta leiriba Tengban Mapugi asengba misingda:<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Eikhoigi Ipa Ibungo Tengban Mapu amadi Ibungo Jisu Christtana nakhoida thoujal amadi ingthaba pinabiba oisanu.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thawaigi oiba yaipha thoujalsing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Eikhoigi Ibungo Jisu Christtagi Tengban Mapusu, mapasu oiba Ibungo mahakpu eikhoina thagatsi. Maramdi eikhoibu Christtaga amata oina punsinnahanbiduna swargada leiba thawaigi yaipha thoujal pumnamakka loinana mahakna eikhoibu yaipha thoujal pinabire. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Maramdi eikhoina Ibungogi mangda asengba oinaba amadi aranba leitananaba malem taibangpan asibu semdringeigi mamangdagisu eikhoibu Christtaga amata oina punsinhanbiduna Tengban Mapu na eikhoibu mahakki oinabagidamak khandokpire.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Mahakki nungsibana maram oiduna, <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Jisu Christtagi mapanna eikhoibu mahakki machasing oinanaba mahakna hanna leppikhre, masi mahakki apenba amadi aningba aduni. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Mahakki nungsiraba Machanupagi mapanna mahakna eikhoida lemna pinabikhraba mahakki thoihellaba thoujal adugidamak eikhoina Tengban Mapubu thagatsi. <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Col 1:14</ref></char></note>Maramdi Tengban Mapugi marang kairaba thoujal adugi matung-inna Christtagi ee-gi mapanna eikhoibu handokpire, haibadi eikhoigi papsing adu kokpire. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Thoujal adu mahakna eikhoida mapan naidana pinabire!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Lousing amadi khangba ngamba pumnamakka loinana, <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Mahakna thourangjakhraba adu Tengban Mapuna pangthokle, aduga Christtagi mapanna mapung phahange haina hanna lepkhraba athuppa thourang adu eikhoida khanghanbire. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Achaba matam aduda Tengban Mapuna mapung phahanbigadaba thourang adudi Christtana makok oiduna swarga amadi malemda leiba khutsem pumnamakpu amata oina punsinbiba aduni.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Thabak pumnamak Tengban Mapuna thourangbiba amadi wareppikhiba adugi matung-inna tou-i. Aduga ahoubadagi houna mahakna lepkhraba aduda yumpham oiba, mahak masagi oiba thourang adugi matung-inna eikhoibu Christtga amata oina punsinbiduna Tengban Mapuna eikhoibu mahak masagi oiba mising oinaba khandokpire. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Adu oirabadi Christtada asha thamjabada ahanba oiriba eikhoina Tengban Mapugi matik mangal adubu thagatsi.<verse eid="EPH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Aduga nakhoina achumba wa adu haibadi nakhoida aran-khubham purakpa Aphaba Pao adu tabada nakhoisu Tengban Mapugi mising oirakle. Nakhoina Christtada thajare aduga Tengban Mapuna wasakpikhiba Thawai Asengba adu nakhoida pibiduna mahakki mi oire haibagi chum adu nakhoida nambire. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Thawai Asengba asimak Tengban Mapuna mahakki oiba misingda wasakpikhibasing adu eikhoina phangjagani haibagi warep-sel aduni, aduga Tengban Mapuna mahakki oikhrabasing aduda mapungphaba ningtamba pibigani haibadu soidre haiba masina khanghanbire. Mahakki matik mangal adu eikhoina thagatsi.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul-gi haijaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Maram asigidamak, Ibungo Jisuda leiriba nakhoigi thajaba amasung Tengban Mapugi mising pumnamakpu nakhoina nungsijaba adu eina hek taba adudagi houduna, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>Eigi haija haijabada nakhoigidamak ningsingjei, aduga nakhoigidamak eina Tengban Mapubu thagatchaba lepchade. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Aduga eikhoigi Ibungo Jisu Christtagi Tengban Mapu, matik mangalgi Mapa aduda, nakhoina mahakpu henna khangnanaba nakhoida lousing amasung phongdokpibagi Thawai adu pibinaba eina nijei. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Amasung nakhoigi pukning adu hangdokpiduna mahakki mangal adu ujananaba eina Tengban Mapuda nijei. Madu mahakna nakhoibu koubibagi asha adu karino haiba nakhoina khangnanaba amadi mahakki asengba misingda mahakna wasakpiramba angakpa yaipha thoujal adu kayada marang kaibano haibadu nakhoina khangnanabani. <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>Amasung madu thajaba eikhoida thabak toubiriba mahakki panggal adu kayada chaobano haibadu nakhoina khangba ngamnanabani. Masigi eikhoida thabak touriba panggal asiga, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Isei 110:1</ref></char></note>Mahakna Christtabu asibasinggi maraktagi hinggat-hanbiba amasung mahakpu swargagi oiba maphamda mahakki yet thangba nakanda phamhanbiba matamda mahakna sijinnakhiba mahakki matik leiraba panggal aduga amatani. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Christtana swargagi leingakpasing, matiksing, pangalsing amasung mapusing pumnamakki mathakta palle; amadi taibangpan asidata nattana lakkadaba adudasu Christtagi mingna matik pumnamakki minggi mathakta lei. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Isei 8:6</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22,23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Col 1:18</ref></char></note>Aduga Tengban Mapuna pumnamak Christtagi khuyada thamle, aduga pumnamakki makok oinanaba Christtabu singlupta pibire. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Singlupti Christtagi hakchangni. Pumnamakpu maram pumnamakta mapung phahanbiba Ibungona singluppu mapung phahanbi.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Sibadagi hingba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1-5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:13">Col 2:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mamangngeida nakhoina nakhoigi haiba indaba amadi papki maramna thawaida sirammi. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Matam aduda nakhoina taibangpangi oiba phattaba machat adugi matung illammi; malangda leiriba thawaigi panggalsinggi mapu adugi, haibadi Tengban Mapuna haiba indaba mising adubu houjik makhada thamliba thawai aduna haiba induna leirammi. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Eikhoi pumnamaksu makhoigumna oirammi amasung hakchanggi amadi pukninggi apamsing adu touduna mahousagi oiba apamsing adugi matung-inna hinglammi. Aduga leiriba atoppa ateisinggumna, mahousana asaobagi machasing oirammi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Adubu Tengban Mapugi chanbiheiba adu asukki matik marang kai amasung mahakna eikhoibu nungsibiba adu mapan naide. <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>Madudi eikhoina ayol aranda siduna leiringeimaktada mahakna eikhoibu Christtaga loinana hinghanbire. Eikhoibu kanbikhiba adu Tengban Mapugi thoujalnani. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Eikhoibu Christta Jisuga amata oina punsinbiduna eikhoibu Christtaga loinana hinggat-hanbire amasung swargagi maphamsingda eikhoibu mahakka loinana phaminnahalle. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Masi mahakna Christta Jisuda, eikhoida utpikhiba nungsiba aduda phongdokpiriba changdamningai leitana marang kairaba mahakki thoujal adu lakkadaba matam pumnamakta utpinanabani. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8-9"/>Maramdi thajabagi mapanna nakhoibu kanbiba adu Tengban Mapugi thoujal mapalnani. Madu nakhoigi hotnajabagi maheina natte adubu Tengban Mapugi khudolni. Madu misingna chaothoktanabani. <verse eid="EPH 2:8-9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Maramdi eikhoina tounanabagidamak Tengban Mapuna hanna langbikhraba aphaba thabaksing adu tounanaba, Christta Jisuda sembikhraba Tengban Mapugi thoidok hendoklaba khutsem adu eikhoi oire.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christtada amata oiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Masana masabu “un kakpa” (haibadi mioibagi khutna masagi hakchangda toujaba) haina koujaba Jihudisingna “un kaktaba” haina kouramba, pokpadagi Jihudi nattaba nakhoina houkhiba matamda kari oirambage haibadu ningsing-u. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Matam aduda nakhoi Christtadagi tonganna leirammi, mireibak macha oirammi, Tengban Mapugi khandoklaba mising adu oiramde. Tengban Mapuna mahakki misingda wasakpiba aduda yumpham oiba warepnaba aduda nakhoigi saruk yaoramde, aduga taibangpan asida asha yaodana amadi Tengban Mapu yaodana leirammi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Adubu houjikti Christtaga amata oina punsinjaduna lapna leiramba nakhoibu Christtagi ee-gi mapanna nakna pusillakle. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Maramdi Christta masamakna Jihudi amasung Jihudi nattabasingbu amata oina oihanbiduna ingthaba pubirakle. Masamakki hakchangbu pithoktuna mahakna makhoigi marakta tokhaihallamba amasung yeknaba oihallamba pal adubu thugaibire. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Col 2:14</ref></char></note>Ibungo mahakna kanglup ani asidagi, masamakta punsinduna anouba kanglup ama semduna asumna ingthaba puraknaba Jihudigi Wayel Yathang adu, madugi yathangsing amadi chatna pathapsing aduga loinana manghalle. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Col 1:20</ref></char></note>Ibungona cross-ta sibibagi mapanna makhoigi yengthinaba adu manghanbikhre. Cross adugi mapanna kanglup ani asibu hakchang amada punsinnahanbire amasung Tengban Mapugi maphamda makhoibu taisinnabire. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa 57:19</ref></char></note>Maram aduna Christtana lenglaktuna nakhoi pumnamakta haibadi Tengban Mapudagi lapna leiramba Jihudi nattaba atoppa Phurup nakhoida amadi manakta nakna leiramba Jihudisingda ingthabagi aphaba wapao asi sandokle. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Eikhoi pumnamakna haibadi Jihudi amadi atoppa phurupsingna Ipagi mangda Thawai amada changjaba ngamba asi Christta mahakki mapalnani.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Maram adumakna nakhoi amuk hanna lamlanba amadi sakhangdaba oidre; adubu Tengban Mapugi misingga loinana houjik leibakmacha oiminnare amadi mahakki imunggi mising oiminnare. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Aduga Christta Jisu masamakna athoiba chithekki nung oiba, pakhonchatpasing amasung Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpiba maichousingna thonggatlamba yumpham adugi mathakta nakhoibusu sagatpire. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Yum apumba adubu punna phajinnahalliba aduga Ibungoda katthoknaba asengba sang ama oihallakliba asi Ibungo mahaknani. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Ibungoga amata oina punsinjaduna atoppa atei pumnamakka loinana nakhoibusu Tengban Mapugi Thawaigi leipham ama oina sagatminnabani.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Jihudi nattabasingda Paul-na thougal touba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Maram asigidamak atoppa phurup nakhoigidamak Christta Jisugi phadok oiriba Paul eihakna Tengban Mapuda haijei. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Nakhoida aphaba oinabagidamak Tengban Mapugi thoujalna thabak asi tounanaba eingonda pibire haibasi nakhoina tasengna takhrabani. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Tengban Mapuna mahakki athuppa thourang pumnamak eingonda phongdokpiduna madu eingonda sengna khanghanbire. (Eina masigi maramda samlappa ikhre. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26">Col 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="COL 1:27">27</ref></char></note> Aduga eina ikhiba adu nakhoina paragadi eina khangliba Christtagi athupa adu nakhoina khangba ngamgani). <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Houkhiba matamsingda athuppa asi Tengban Mapuna mioibada phongdokpiramde. Adubu houjikti Thawaigi mapanna mahakki asengba pakhonchatpasingda amasung Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpasingda phongdokpire. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Athupa adudi Aphaba Paogi mapanna atoppa phurupsingna Jihudisingga loinana Tengban Mapugi yaipha thoujal adu saruk phangminnaba; makhoina hakchang amatagi hakchang kayat oiminnaba amasung Christtagi mapanna Tengban Mapuna wasakpikhiba wasak adugi saruk phangminnaba asini.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Mahakki panggalna thabak subibagi mapanna Tengban Mapuna iphamda pinabikhraba mahakki thoidokpa khudolgi mapanna eihakpu Aphaba Paogi minai ama oihanbire. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Eihakti Tengban Mapugi mising pumnamakki maraktagi khwaidagi tonba adudagisu henna tolli. Adumakpu Christtagi mapal naidraba lal adugi Aphaba Pao asi atoppa phurupsingda sandokpagi thoujal asi Tengban Mapuna iphamda pinabire. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Amasung Tengban Mapugi athuppa thourang adu kamdouna mahei yalhan-gadage haibadu mipum khudingmakta uhannaba khudongchaba adu iphamda pinabire. Athupa asi pot pumnamakpu sembiba Mapu, Tengban Mapuna houkhraba miron pumnamakta thuptuna thamlammi. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Masi swargagi maphamsingda leiba leingakpa amadi matik leibasingda, tongan tonganba sak-ongda leiriba mahakki lousing adu houjik singlupki mapanna khanghannabani. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Tengban Mapuna masi eikhoigi Ibungo Christta Jisugi mapanna thunghanbikhraba mahakki lomba naidraba thourang adugi matung inna toubani. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Eikhoina Christtaga amata oina punsinjabagi mapanna amadi mangonda thajabagi mapanna Tengban Mapugi mangda thouna phana amadi pukning lumna changba phangjei. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Maram aduna nakhoigidamak eina awa anang phangbada nakhoina pukning hanthadanaba eina nijari. Maramdi masi nakhoibu ikai khumnanabani.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christtagi nungsiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Maram asigidamak eihakna Ipa Ibungo mahakki mamangda khu-leitana khurumjei. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Swarga amasung taibang malemda leiriba pumnamakna Ibungo mangondagi makhoigi punsi adu phangjei. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Aduga nakhoigi nunggi oiba mi adu kalhanbinaba mahakki Thawaigi mapanna mahakki matik mangalgi langeidagi nakhoida panggal adu pinabinaba eina Tengban Mapugi maphamda nijari. <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>Amasung thajabagi mapanna Christtana nakhoigi thamoida leinanaba eina nijei. Aduga nakhoina nungsibada mara tannanaba amadi yumpham thongatnaba eina Tengban Mapuda nijei. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>Madu nakhoina amadi Tengban Mapugi mi pumnamakna, Christtagi nungsiba adugi marak amadi mayung, awangba amadi aruba adu khangba ngamnabagi panggal adu leinanabani. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Aduga kananasu mapung phana keidounungda khangba ngamdaba oirabasu, nakhoina Christtagi nungsiba adu khanglaknabani. Aduga asumna Tengban Mapugi machat-matou aduna nakhoida mapung phana thalhanbinabani.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Eikhoida thabak toubiriba mahakki panggal adugi mapanna, eikhoina hek nijaba amadi khanba ngamba adudagi yamna hendokna touba ngamliba Ibungo mangonda: <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Singlupta amadi Christta Jisuda, matam pumnamakta lomba naida naidana Tengban Mapugi matik mangal oirasanu! Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Christtagi hakchangda amata oiba amadi mapung phaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Aduga Ibungogidamak phadok oiriba eihakna, Tengban Mapuna koubiba adugi matik chaba punsi marel aduda hingnanaba nakhoida insinjari. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12">Col 3:12</ref>,<ref loc="COL 3:13">13</ref></char></note>Matam pumnamakta nollukpa, pukning tappa amasung akhaang kanba oibiyu. Amaga amaga khaangnabagi mapanna nakhoigi nungsiba adu utlu. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Nakhoibu amata oina punsinbiriba ingthaba adugi mapanna Thawai Asengbana pibiba apunbagi lipun adu ngaktuna thamnaba kanna hotnabiyu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Tengban Mapuna nakhoibu koubikhiba matamda nakhoibu asha amada koubikhiba adugumna hakchang ama amasung Thawai ama lei. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Aduga Ibungo ama, thajaba ama amasung baptize louba ama lei; <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Tengban Mapu ama lei, mahakti eikhoi pumnamakki Ipani. Mahakna pumnamakki mathakta palli, pumnamakta thabak toubi, pumnamakta leibi.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Adubu Christtana yenthokpibagi matung-inna pibikhraba akhannaba khudol adu eikhoi khudingmakna phangjare. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Isei 68:18</ref></char></note> Maram asimakna Mapugi Puyana asumna hai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Mahakna awangba maphamda kakhatpa matamda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Mahakka loinana mahakna yamlaba lanphasingbu pure;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Aduga mahakki misingda khudol pibire.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Masida, “mahakna kakhatpa” hairibasi karino? Masida hairiba asi mahakna malemgi khwaidagi nemba mapham aduda hanna kumtharakkhi haibani. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Maram aduna makhada kumlakkhiba mahak asi taibangpan apumbabu thalhannaba nongmadon atiya pumnamaktagisu henna wangna mathakta kakhatkhiba mahak adumakni. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Aduga mahakna mi kharabuna pakhonchatpa, kharana Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpa, khara amana Aphaba Pao sandokpa aduga khara amana amuk pastor amasung ojasing oinaba pibire. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Mahakna masi Christtagi hakchang adubu sagatnabagidamak Tengban Mapugi mi pumnamakpu thougalgi thabakkidamak thourang tounaba toubibani. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Aduga masi eikhoi pumnamakna thajabada amadi Tengban Mapugi Machanupa adubu khangbada amata oiba adu youdriphaoba amasung mapung phaba oiraktuna, Christtagi mapungphaba adugi awangba chang adu oiraktriba phaobagini. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Adudagi eikhoi ithakna koipu puba amadi misingbu makhoina semba taatna aranbada chingba lounam touba misinggi tambibagi nungsit khudingna koihum humba apikpa angangsing amuk oiraroi. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Madugi mahutta, achumba adu nungsina ngangduna, maram khudingda eikhoina chaokhattuna, henna henna makok oiriba Christtagum oirakkadabani. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Col 2:19</ref></char></note>Mahakki pangal makhada tongan tonganba hakchang kayat pumnamak samjinnei, aduga samjinnapham khudingmak phajinnabagi mapanna hakchang apumba adu chetna thammi. Maram aduna tongangba kayatsingna magi magi toupham thokpa adu tourabada, hakchang apumba adu chaokhatlak-i amasung nungsibagi mapanna madu mathanta sagatchei.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christtada anouba punsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Maram aduna Ibungogi mingda eina nakhoida cheksin wa asi hairi, mamal yaodaba wakhal chelliba, Tengban Mapu khangdaba misinggumna nakhoina amuk hingganu. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Makhoigi pukningdi amambada lei. Tengban Mapuna pinabiba punsi aduda makhoigi saruk leite, maramdi makhoina kari amata khangde amasung ngak kalli. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Makhoigi ikaiba khangbagi wakhal pumnamak mangkhre; makhoina oktaba lamchatta masamakpu pithokchei amasung makhal khudingmakki sengdaba pumnamak karaambaga loinana makhoina tou-i.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Adumakpu nakhoina Christtagi maramda tamkhiba adudi madu natte! <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Nakhoina tasengna mahakki maramda takhre, aduga mahakki tung-inba ama oina nakhoina Jisuda leiba achumba adu tamkhre. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Col 3:9</ref></char></note>Maram aduna nakhoina hanna hinglamba punsi aduda nakhoibu hinghalliba ariba mi haibadi lounam chaoba apambasing aduna mang-hankhraba ariba mi adu thadok-u. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Nakhoigi thamoi amasung pukning pumnou nouhanduna, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:10">Col 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 1:26">Meihou 1:26</ref></char></note>Achumba chatpa amadi asengbada, Tengban Mapu manna semkhraba anouba mi adu nakhoina setlo.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zec 8:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Maram aduna minamba amuk nganglaganu! Nakhoi khudingna atoppa thajaba ichil inaosingda achumba ngang-u, maramdi eikhoi pumnamak Christtagi hakchanggi kayat oiminnari. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Isei 4:4</ref></char></note>Nahakna saoba matamda, nahakki asaoba aduna nahakpu papta tahan-ganu, aduga nahakki asaobadu numit chuppa leihanganu. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Devil-da khudongchaba piganu. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Huranduna leiramba mahak adunasu amuk hurandaduna sengna hingnanaba amadi awatpa leiriba misingda pangbiba ngamnaba makhutmakna thabak susanu. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Nakhoigi nachindagi karigumba phattaba wahei amatta thok-han-ganu. Adubu atabasingda aphaba oinanaba kanaba waheising haibadi semgatpiba amadi mathou taba adubu thunghanbiba wa adukhakta ngang-u. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Handokpibagi numit adugidamak nakhoibu chum nambikhraba Tengban Mapugi Thawai Asengba adubu wahan-ganu. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Pukning khaba, meihouna saoba, asaoba, khatna cheinaba amadi thina ngangba, loinana makhal khudinggi tukkachaningai oiba wakhal, pumnamak adu thadok-u. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Col 3:13</ref></char></note>Madugi mahutta, nakhoi amaga amagagi marakta chanbiheiba amadi pukning nouba oibiyu, aduga Tengban Mapunasu Christtagi mapanna nakhoibu kokpiba adugumna nakhoi amaga amaga koknou.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Mangalda hingba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Nakhoina Tengban Mapugi nungsiraba machasing oiba maramna nakhoina mahakki matou loubiyu. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Khong 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Isei 40:6</ref></char></note>Christtana eikhoibu nungsibiba amadi Tengban Mapubu pelhanba manam nungsiba katnapot amadi iratpot amagum eikhoigidamak mahakki punsi pithokpa adugumna nakhoina nungsibada chatlu.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Adubu nakhoigi mathakta nupa nupi lannaba, nattraga sengdabagi nattraga kaarambagi maramda misingna hainahannabagi maram amata piganu, maramdi asising asi Tengban Mapugi asengba misinggidamak matik chade. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Aduga amotpa wangang, apangba wangang amadi phattaba phagi-jugaigi wa-ngang asi nakhoigidamak matik chade. Adugi mahutta nakhoina Tengban Mapubu thagatlu. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Nakhoina soidana khanggadaba adudi lamchat motpa, sengdaba aduga kaaramba (maramdi kaaramba haibasi lai muri latpagi masak amani) kanagumba amatanasu Christtagi amadi Tengban Mapugi ningthou leibakta phangpham thokpa kari amata leite.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Mi kana amatana nakhoibu apangba waheina namthak toudasanu maramdi asigumbasing asigi maramna Tengban Mapugi asaoba adu haiba indabasing adugi mathakta lak-i. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Maram aduna asigumba mising asiga saruk phangminnaganu. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Nakhoi matam amada amambana thallami, adubu houjikti nakhoina Ibungoda mangal oire. Maram aduna nakhoina mangalgi machasinggumna hing-u. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Maramdi aphaba, achumba chatpa amadi achumbagi marang kaiba mahei purakpa adu mangal asinani. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Aduga karina Ibungobu pelhanbage haibadu khangnanaba hotnou. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Misingna touba amambagi oiba kannadaba thabaksing aduda yaoruganu, madugi mahutta makhoibu phongdok-u. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Haiba indabasing aduna lonna touba thabaksing adugi maramda panba phaoba tasengna yamna ikainingngaini. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Adubu pumnamak mangalda phongdokpa matamda makhoigi asengba machattu sengna phongdokpigani. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Maramdi pumnamakpu uba ngamhalliba adu mangalnani. Maram aduna asumna hai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Tumliba nahak hougatlo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Asibadagi nahak hougatlo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Aduga Christtana nahakki nathakta nganbigani.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Maram aduna nakhoina karamna hinglibage haibadu cheksillu. Nakhoina apangba misingumna hingganu adubu asingba misinggumna hing-u. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Col 4:5</ref></char></note>Nakhoida leiba khudongchaba khudingmakpu heisingna sijinnahou maramdi matam asi phatte. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Maram aduna apangba oiganu adubu Ibungona nakhoida touhanningba adu karino haibadu khangnaba hotnou.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Nakhoina yu ngaoganu maramdi maduna nakhoigi punsi manghan-gani. Madugi mahutta Thawaina thalhallu. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19,20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16">Col 3:16</ref>,<ref loc="COL 3:17">17</ref></char></note>Nakhoi amaga amagagi marakta thagat isei, laison isei, amadi thawaigi oiba iseina ngangna saknou. Aduga thamoinungda Ibungobu thagatchabaga loinana isei sak-u. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Maram pumnamakkidamak Ibungo Jisu Christtagi mingda matam pumnamakta Mapa Ibungo Tengban Mapubu thagatlu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christian-gi imung-manung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Christtabu nakhoina kina luna chatchabagi maramna nakhoina amaga amaga makha ponnou.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:18">Col 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pet 3:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nupisa nakhoina Ibungogi makha ponjabagumna nakhoina napuroibagi makha pollu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Maramdi Christtana singlupki makok oibagumna mapuroibana nupigi makokni. Aduga Christta masamak mahakki hakchang oiriba singlupki kanbiba mapuni. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Aduga singlupna Christtagi makha ponbagumna nupisingnasu hiram khudingmakta mapuroibagi makha ponsanu.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:19">Col 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pet 3:7</ref></char>
    </note>Mapuroibasa, Christtana singluppu nungsiba amadi mahakki punsi singlupkidamak katthokkhibagumna nakhoigi nupisingbu nungsiyu. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Mahakna masi singluppu asengba oihannaba waheigi mapanna isingna chamthokpiduna sengdokpi. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Madu singluppu matik mangalgi singlup ama oina achuba amadi kusinba yaodana, amadi atoppa athiba kari amatasu yaodana, asengba amadi amakpa leitana masamakta katchanabagidamakni. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Masiga chap mannana mapuroibasingsu makhoi masa masamakki hakchangbu nungsibagumna makhoigi nupisingbu nungsigadabani. Mahak masagi nupibu nungsiba mahak aduna mahak masabu nungsibani. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Pumnamakki mathakta eikhoi kananasu keidounungda isagi hakchangbu tukkachaba toude. Madugi mahutta Christtana singlupta toubagumna eikhoina eikhoigi hachangbu yokkhatchei amadi yengsinjei. <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Maramdi eikhoidi mahakki hakchanggi kayatsingni. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Meihou 2:24</ref></char></note>Mapugi Puyada haibagumna, “Maram asimakna nupa amana mahakki mama mapabu thadoktuna magi nupida punsin-gani. Aduga makhoi ani hakchang amata oigani.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Masi khangbada waba athupa wani, adubu eina Christta amasung singlupki maramda haibani. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Adumakpu, mapuroiba khudingna masagi nupibu masamakpu nungsibagum nungsigadabani, aduga nupi khudingna mahakki mapuroibabu ikai khumnagadabani.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Angangsing amadi mama mapasing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:20">Col 3:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Angangsa, nakhoina Ibungogi oiba maramna nama napana haiba illu, maramdi madu touba achumbani. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2,3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Khong 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Aniwa 5:16</ref></char></note>Nama napabu ikai-khumnou” haibasi wasakpiba amaga loinaba ahanba yathangni, haibadi: <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>“Madu nahakki naphamda yaiphaba oinanabani, aduga nahakna malemda punsi nungsangna pannabani.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:21">Col 3:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mapa oibasa, nakhoina nachasingbu saohan-gadaba ma-ongda loinaganu. Madugi mahutta Ibungona yabiba adu takpiduna amadi tambiduna makhoibu yokkhatpiyu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mapu amadi manai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5-8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:22-25">Col 3:22-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Manaisa, nakhoina taibangpangi oiba nakhoigi mapusingbu ikai khumnaba amadi kibaga loinana haiba illu aduga madu Christtada thougal toubagumna thamoi sengna tou. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Makhoigi chanbiba phangnanaba khakkidamak makhoigi mamangda makhoina haiba inba nattaduna Christtagi manai ama oina Tengban Mapugi aningbasing adu thawai yaona tou. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Misingbu thougal touba nattaduna Ibungobu thougal toubagumna nakhoina thawai yaona thougal tou. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Maramdi minai oirabasu nattraga ning-tamba mi oirabasu eikhoina toujaba aphaba thabak khudingmakki mana Ibungona pibigani haiba eikhoina khang-i.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:25">Col 3:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:1">4:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Aniwa 10:17</ref></char>
    </note>Mapu oibasa, nakhoinasu maduga chap manana nakhoigi minaisingda toubiyu. Makhoibu kihanba touganu, maramdi nakhoigisu aduga makhoigisu Mapu oiriba Ibungo adu swargada lei haiba nakhoina khang-i aduga mangondadi michang mikhai naiba leite.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapugi lanphijet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Aroiba oina, Ibungoga tinnajabagi mapanna amadi mahakki kallaba panggal adugi mapanna nakhoi panggal kanba oibiyu. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Nakhoina Devil-gi phattraba khujin thourang adugi maiyokta leppa ngamnaba Tengban Mapuna pibiba lanphijet apumba setchillu. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Maramdi eikhoina mioibagi maiyokta lanthengnaba natte adubu swargagi maphamsingda leiriba phattaba thawaisinggi oiba panggalsing, leingakpasing, matiksing, amadi amamba taibanpan asigi panggalsing aduga lanthengnabani. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Maram aduna houjik Tengban Mapugi lanphijet adu setchillo! Adu oirabadi phattabagi numit adu lakpada yeknabagi laanda aduda nakhoina maiyoknaba ngamgani aduga aroiba phaoba soknaraba matungda, nakhoina khongpham handana adumak leppa ngamgani.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isa 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59:17</ref></char>
    </note>Maram aduna nakhoi thourang touro, achumbana nakhoigi khawangda khwangjet oina chetna laksillu amadi achumba chatpana thabakkhang oina happu, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref></char></note>Aduga ingthabagi Aphaba Pao adu laothoknaba thourang touba aduna nakhoigi khongda khong-up oina tongsillu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Pumnamakki mathakta thajababu chunggoi oina paikhatlu, maramdi maduna Phattaba Mahak aduna kaplakpa meihouba tenjeising adu nakhoina muthatpa ngamgani. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref></char></note>Aduga aran-khubhambu lan luhup oina amasung Tengban Mapugi waheibu Thawaina nakhoida pibiba thangsang oina lousillu. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Tengban Mapugi mateng nijaduna pumnamaksing asi Tengban Mapuda haijou. Hiram khudingmakta Thawaina chingbibagi mapanna Tengban Mapuda haijabiyu. Maram asigidamak mitseng khaangduna leibiyu amasung keidounungda thadokanu; matam pumnamakta Tengban Mapugi mi pumnamakkidamak Tengban Mapuda haijabiyu. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Aduga eina thouna phana ngangnaba amadi Aphaba Paogi athuppa adu khanghanba ngamnaba, eina ngangnaba thourangjaba matamda Tengban Mapuna waheising adu iphamda pinabinaba eihakkidamaktasu haijabiyu. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Eihak houjik keisum sangda leijarabasu Aphaba Pao asigidamak eihak paopuba amani. Aphaba Paosi eina sandokpham thokpagumna thouna phana sandokpa ngamnaba eigidamak haijabiyu.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aroiba khurumjaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Pakhon 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Tim 4:12</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:21,22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:7">Col 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>Eina karamna leiriba amadi kari touriba haibadu nakhoinasu khangjanaba eikhoigi nungsiraba ichil-inao amadi Ibungogi thougalda thajaba yaba manai oiriba Tychicus-na pao pumnamak nakhoida tamgani. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Maram asigidamak haibadi eikhoina matou karamna lellibage haibadu mahakna nakhoida khanghannaba amasung nakhoibu pukning thougat-hanbinaba eina mahakpu nanakta thakhibani.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Ipa Ibungo Tengban Mapu amasung Ibungo Jisu Christtana ichil-inao pumnamakta ingthaba amadi thajabaga loinana nungsiba pinabisanu. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Eikhoigi Ibungo Jisu Christtabu mutpa naidana nungsijaba pumnamakta Tengban Mapugi thoujal adu pinabisanu.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
